Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(motion): port declarative Motion onto
 MainThreadObject main

Carries the declarative component, variant, gesture and lifecycle
implementation validated at 013e20e onto the MainThreadObject runtime that
landed in #3788/#3789: MotionValue handles use downcast()/creationPayload,
the factory is a capture-free main-thread function, and background set()
is forwarded through runOnMainThread.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
